    "title": "Everything You Need to Know About Applying to Prairie View A&M University",
    "text": "Prairie View A&M University has an acceptance rate of 78%. Half the applicants admitted to Prairie View A&M University who submitted test scores have an ACT score between 16 and 21. However, one quarter of admitted applicants achieved scores above these ranges and one quarter scored below these ranges. Admissions officials at Prairie View A&M University consider a student's GPA a very important academic factor. An applicant's high school class rank, when available, is considered very important for admissions officials at Prairie View A&M University. To see additional academic factors along with other school data, learn more about College Compass. Prairie View A&M University Admissions StatsWill You Get Into Prairie View A&M University?College Admissions CalculatorSee How You CompareSign up for a free U.S. News account to see how you stack up against applicants seeking admission at any school.Already have an account?Log in now.InterestedInterestedAppliedAppliedAcceptedAcceptedEnrolledEnrolledRejectedRejectedWaitlistedWaitlistedSee How You CompareSign up for a free U.S. News account to see how you stack up against applicants seeking admission at any school.Already have an account?Log in now.InterestedInterestedAppliedAppliedAcceptedAcceptedEnrolledEnrolledRejectedRejectedWaitlistedWaitlistedData provided by U.S. News College Compass Users.Prairie View A&M University Admissions RequirementsRequired Standardized TestsNot considered for admission, even if submittedSAT/ACT Scores Must Be Received ByN/APrairie View A&M University ApplicationsEarly Decision DeadlineN/ACommon Application AcceptedYesDeadline for housing depositN/APriority application deadlineEntering Class StatsEarly Decision Acceptance RateN/AEarly action acceptance rateAcceptance rate (excluding early action and early decision students)Transfer StudentsAccepting applicationsFall, Spring, SummerMinimum credits to apply15Minimum required college GPA2Guaranteed admission agreement URLN/AInternatio